WEBVTT

00:00:01.030 --> 00:00:02.880
My name is Taiki Kudou.

00:00:02.880 --> 00:00:05.850
I was taken to this mysterious 
place called the Digital World,

00:00:06.150 --> 00:00:07.590
where I met Shoutmon

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:10.320
and the other creatures of 
this world, called Digimon.

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.290
<b>Team Bagra</b>

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.290
<b>Enemy?                          The battle begins!                      Enemy</b>

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.290
<b>Team ?             Xros Heart(Team Taiki)     Team Kiriha</b>

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.290
Mysterious                                               Protagonist                                                              Rival
Girl

00:00:10.320 --> 00:00:15.290
<b>Enemy?                                Enemy?

00:00:10.760 --> 00:00:13.630
This world is having a lot of trouble

00:00:13.630 --> 00:00:15.290
with the attacking Bagra Army.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:19.260
What are you talking about, Lucemon?

00:00:19.260 --> 00:00:21.020
I don't want to believe it...

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:23.400
But that's his true self, Shoutmon.

00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:26.520
He's been acting like a 
good guy all this time

00:00:26.520 --> 00:00:28.770
so he could get the Code Crown.

00:00:35.580 --> 00:00:37.450
You won't get away with that!

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:43.440
Lucemon is out of control

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:45.890
after absorbing the dark power 
that was sealed in this Zone,

00:00:46.350 --> 00:00:48.030
and Nene got caught up in it!

00:00:49.890 --> 00:00:58.440
<b>A Miraculous DigiXros!</b>

00:00:51.030 --> 00:00:58.440
<b>Shoutmon X5 Takes Flight!</b>

00:00:52.690 --> 00:00:56.990
A Miraculous DigiXros! 
Shoutmon X5 Takes Flight!

00:01:12.870 --> 00:01:14.000
Nene!

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:22.630
Nene!

00:01:31.410 --> 00:01:32.970
Is that...

00:01:38.430 --> 00:01:39.780
Lucemon?

00:01:41.710 --> 00:01:45.550
I don't need the Code Crown anymore.

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:48.120
As long as I have this power!

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:05.940
That's Lucemon?

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:07.480
Look!

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:07.910
What?

00:02:10.780 --> 00:02:11.240
Nene!

00:02:11.580 --> 00:02:12.340
She's in there?!

00:02:25.640 --> 00:02:27.510
Stop, Lucemon!

00:02:27.510 --> 00:02:28.350
It's no use!

00:02:28.350 --> 00:02:29.790
He's nothing more than a monster now!

00:02:42.540 --> 00:02:43.790
He's flying...

00:02:45.380 --> 00:02:46.480
Nene!

00:02:49.010 --> 00:02:50.550
Sparrowmon!

00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:57.500
Wow...

00:02:57.500 --> 00:02:58.020
But...

00:03:00.330 --> 00:03:01.090
It's not working!

00:03:01.090 --> 00:03:03.400
Taiki, we have to attack, too!

00:03:03.400 --> 00:03:05.900
Wait! Let's save Nene first!

00:03:05.900 --> 00:03:07.100
Nene?!

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:08.290
Wait a minute!

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:11.460
It's her fault this happened 
to the Heaven Zone!

00:03:11.460 --> 00:03:12.270
Still...

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:18.680
This is... the dark power?

00:03:18.980 --> 00:03:21.530
I can't turn my back on 
someone who's suffering!

00:03:22.980 --> 00:03:24.530
I'll follow you.

00:03:24.530 --> 00:03:25.750
Beelzebumon!

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:30.150
Honestly, you're one strange General.

00:03:30.470 --> 00:03:33.290
But that's the great thing about Taiki.

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:34.360
Thanks.

00:03:36.690 --> 00:03:37.830
Shoutmon!

00:03:37.830 --> 00:03:39.830
Okay!

00:03:39.830 --> 00:03:41.400
Ballistamon!

00:03:43.600 --> 00:03:44.600
Dorulumon!

00:03:47.110 --> 00:03:48.320
Starmons!

00:03:48.320 --> 00:03:49.620
Yes!

00:03:51.340 --> 00:03:52.880
DigiXros!

00:03:52.880 --> 00:03:54.510
DigiXros!

00:03:56.180 --> 00:03:59.120
Shoutmon X4!

00:04:04.160 --> 00:04:07.670
First, Beelzebumon, 
who can fly, will rescue Nene.

00:04:07.670 --> 00:04:08.650
Got it!

00:04:10.270 --> 00:04:12.410
And X4 will cover him from the ground.

00:04:12.410 --> 00:04:13.100
Right!

00:04:13.510 --> 00:04:14.730
What are they trying to do?

00:04:19.590 --> 00:04:21.240
<i>What a barrage...</i>

00:04:21.240 --> 00:04:23.540
<i>Sparrowmon dodged all this?</i>

00:04:23.540 --> 00:04:25.380
Lay down cover fire!

00:04:25.380 --> 00:04:28.150
I can't! I'll hit Beelzebumon!

00:04:30.730 --> 00:04:31.350
Why, you...

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:43.510
X4!

00:04:44.420 --> 00:04:46.900
If only I could fly...

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:50.570
You guys...

00:04:51.100 --> 00:04:51.770
Now's my chance!

00:04:51.770 --> 00:04:53.710
Random Laser!

00:04:58.830 --> 00:04:59.540
Sparrowmon!

00:05:02.580 --> 00:05:04.390
Even Sparrowmon...

00:05:04.820 --> 00:05:06.120
Look, Taiki!

00:05:06.440 --> 00:05:07.750
What?

00:05:08.130 --> 00:05:09.490
That is...

00:05:16.500 --> 00:05:17.510
Huh?

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:18.930
Where am I?

00:05:18.930 --> 00:05:21.400
What was I just doing?

00:05:23.970 --> 00:05:25.650
The Digimon have...

00:05:26.270 --> 00:05:28.510
...returned to normal?

00:05:29.090 --> 00:05:34.280
Lucemon intends to absorb all 
the dark power in this Zone!

00:05:41.390 --> 00:05:43.520
If you want to retreat, this is the time.

00:05:43.520 --> 00:05:45.500
I'll keep an eye on him.

00:05:45.500 --> 00:05:47.160
Beelzebumon...

00:05:47.160 --> 00:05:50.380
Okay. If anything happens, 
let me know with the Wrister.

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:51.120
All right.

00:05:51.760 --> 00:05:54.910
Xros Heart is retreating!

00:05:54.910 --> 00:05:57.960
Lucemon's rampage was unexpected.

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:01.310
But this works to our advantage.

00:06:01.310 --> 00:06:04.210
Please, go as wild as you like.

00:06:07.560 --> 00:06:13.350
With the shrine destroyed, 
we can't seal the dark power.

00:06:13.350 --> 00:06:16.250
So defeating Lucemon is the only way.

00:06:16.250 --> 00:06:17.690
More importantly!

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:21.660
Why did Nene have to be 
captured by the enemy?!

00:06:20.590 --> 00:06:22.210
I-I don't...

00:06:22.210 --> 00:06:24.500
It's the power of the Gehenna.

00:06:24.500 --> 00:06:28.330
The Gehenna is a black sphere that 
absorbs darkness in the heart.

00:06:28.330 --> 00:06:30.190
She is probably being held there

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:34.470
because of a great darkness 
within her heart.

00:06:37.780 --> 00:06:40.140
Nene! Nene!

00:06:41.360 --> 00:06:42.010
Nene!

00:06:44.270 --> 00:06:45.990
Sparrowmon...

00:06:45.990 --> 00:06:47.550
Are you okay, Nene?

00:06:47.990 --> 00:06:50.380
Yeah... I just...

00:06:51.400 --> 00:06:53.550
had a bad dream.

00:06:55.560 --> 00:07:00.100
Anyway, weren't you scared 
by that battle today?

00:07:00.100 --> 00:07:01.670
Not at all.

00:07:01.670 --> 00:07:04.240
Because you were with me, Nene.

00:07:08.230 --> 00:07:11.480
I'm not scared either, 
because you're with me, Sparrowmon.

00:07:11.480 --> 00:07:13.750
Really? Then we feel the same!

00:07:13.750 --> 00:07:16.130
It's because we're friends, isn't it?

00:07:16.130 --> 00:07:18.390
That's right.

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:22.450
<i>Yes...</i>

00:07:22.950 --> 00:07:25.760
<i>Whether I'm happy or sad,</i>

00:07:25.760 --> 00:07:28.360
<i>Sparrowmon shares my feelings.</i>

00:07:31.230 --> 00:07:34.410
<i>Thanks to you, I...</i>

00:07:39.340 --> 00:07:40.370
Oh, you're awake?

00:07:40.370 --> 00:07:42.260
Are you in pain?

00:07:42.840 --> 00:07:43.880
Don't touch me!

00:07:43.880 --> 00:07:45.880
I have to save Nene!

00:07:45.880 --> 00:07:47.740
What? You can't save her by yourself!

00:07:47.740 --> 00:07:49.100
Who cares?!

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:51.520
While I'm lying here, Nene is...

00:07:51.520 --> 00:07:53.520
Let's go together.

00:07:53.520 --> 00:07:56.550
Sparrowmon, let's go save Nene together.

00:07:57.350 --> 00:07:59.690
Wh-What are you saying?

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:01.280
We're not even on the same team!

00:08:01.870 --> 00:08:03.680
We want to save Nene, too!

00:08:03.930 --> 00:08:05.990
Don't talk nonsense!

00:08:05.990 --> 00:08:08.330
You were just fighting against Nene earlier!

00:08:08.630 --> 00:08:10.200
But right now...

00:08:10.200 --> 00:08:13.780
Shut up! I won't listen to 
anyone other than Nene!

00:08:21.680 --> 00:08:22.540
Taiki!

00:08:23.410 --> 00:08:24.920
Beelzebumon here.

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:26.350
I've got bad news.

00:08:28.290 --> 00:08:29.670
What is this?

00:08:29.670 --> 00:08:31.400
That Lucemon!

00:08:31.400 --> 00:08:35.270
Has he started to absorb the 
data of the Zone itself?

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:39.800
At this rate, the town and the 
Digimon will all be swallowed!

00:08:43.100 --> 00:08:45.110
We have to stop him, fast!

00:08:45.110 --> 00:08:46.140
I know.

00:08:46.140 --> 00:08:49.440
Ballistamon, make us a Wrister, quick.

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:51.160
Make a Wrister.

00:08:51.870 --> 00:08:54.360
Wrister is done.

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:55.250
Thanks.

00:08:55.250 --> 00:08:58.230
Sparrowmon, this is a Wrister.

00:08:58.230 --> 00:08:59.620
It lets us communicate with our teammates.

00:08:59.620 --> 00:09:01.570
I'm not your teammate!

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:07.700
Off we go!

00:09:14.420 --> 00:09:16.400
<i>I promise I'll save you, Nene!</i>

00:09:26.520 --> 00:09:30.170
The monsters born in the 
Digital realm: Digimon.

00:09:30.170 --> 00:09:32.710
They may be made up of data,

00:09:32.710 --> 00:09:37.560
but they're our precious friends 
who cry, laugh, and fight for us.

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:39.620
Join us in our world of adventure

00:09:40.000 --> 00:09:43.190
as we gather lots more teammates!

00:09:43.190 --> 00:09:44.260
DigiXros!

00:11:06.960 --> 00:11:09.370
Why won't you go save Nene?!

00:11:09.370 --> 00:11:11.920
Calm down.

00:11:11.920 --> 00:11:15.080
Nene is in the middle 
of an important task.

00:11:16.570 --> 00:11:17.420
Look.

00:11:18.270 --> 00:11:24.960
Nene's negative feelings are 
further purifying the dark power.

00:11:24.960 --> 00:11:27.320
But if Nene stays there, she'll die!

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:30.170
She won't die so easily.

00:11:30.560 --> 00:11:33.380
Let's just sit back and watch...

00:11:33.380 --> 00:11:35.540
how the Gehenna changes.

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:36.850
No...

00:11:42.680 --> 00:11:47.450
You're too big to teleport!

00:11:47.450 --> 00:11:48.320
Got the plan?

00:11:48.320 --> 00:11:50.480
Cut a hole in the Gehenna 
with the Star Sword,

00:11:50.480 --> 00:11:52.760
and I'll fly in and save Nene.

00:11:52.760 --> 00:11:54.030
Right!

00:11:54.030 --> 00:11:56.260
But even if I try to distract him...

00:11:57.460 --> 00:11:59.630
Will they be okay?

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:01.600
Oh, no!

00:12:06.840 --> 00:12:07.740
Guys!

00:12:07.740 --> 00:12:09.360
I can't! My wings are broken!

00:12:09.360 --> 00:12:11.330
I'm finished, as well!

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.360
There's no other choice! 
Make an emergency landing!

00:12:18.820 --> 00:12:19.850
Sparrowmon!

00:12:19.850 --> 00:12:22.650
<i>Nene, I'll save you by 
myself if I have to!</i>

00:12:31.060 --> 00:12:32.000
Destroy the Gehenna!

00:12:32.000 --> 00:12:33.900
Random Laser!

00:12:35.630 --> 00:12:37.700
Wing Edge!

00:12:45.640 --> 00:12:47.080
His attacks aren't working!

00:12:52.520 --> 00:12:53.720
Sparrowmon!

00:12:55.870 --> 00:12:57.520
Darn it...

00:12:57.980 --> 00:12:59.650
Cover Sparrowmon!

00:12:59.650 --> 00:13:01.090
They can't!

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:03.310
I can't heal them that quickly!

00:13:04.780 --> 00:13:06.400
Isn't there any way?

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:19.830
Stop...

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:21.410
Just stop already!

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:24.520
Give...

00:13:25.980 --> 00:13:29.090
Give Nene back!

00:13:43.100 --> 00:13:44.550
Sparrowmon!

00:13:47.840 --> 00:13:49.600
I'll use a DigiMemory!

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:52.340
<b>Patamon</b>

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:52.340
<b>Attack: Air Gust</b>

00:13:52.360 --> 00:13:53.980
DigiMemory!

00:13:56.480 --> 00:13:57.690
Patamon!

00:13:58.620 --> 00:14:00.420
Air Gust, activate!

00:14:11.710 --> 00:14:12.650
It's...

00:14:13.270 --> 00:14:15.170
A stairway in the sky!

00:14:15.170 --> 00:14:16.700
Here we go!

00:14:25.040 --> 00:14:26.140
Sparrowmon!

00:14:33.350 --> 00:14:34.890
Nene!

00:14:35.270 --> 00:14:36.520
Sparrowmon!

00:14:43.090 --> 00:14:45.000
Don't!

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:53.290
<i>It's no use... I'm done for...</i>

00:14:54.760 --> 00:14:55.820
<i>Nene...</i>

00:14:57.430 --> 00:14:58.730
<i>I'm sorry...</i>

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:02.380
Don't give up!

00:15:12.060 --> 00:15:13.710
Sparrowmon! Get Nene!

00:15:16.990 --> 00:15:18.500
Nene!

00:15:28.970 --> 00:15:30.070
He did it!

00:15:34.200 --> 00:15:35.350
Nene!

00:15:35.350 --> 00:15:36.910
Sparrowmon!

00:15:38.560 --> 00:15:39.670
Nene!

00:15:46.490 --> 00:15:47.340
<i>Taiki...</i>

00:15:49.460 --> 00:15:50.620
<i>You...</i>

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:54.420
<i>We want to save Nene, too!</i>

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:00.990
Thank goodness they're okay.

00:16:08.610 --> 00:16:09.210
Taiki!

00:16:11.220 --> 00:16:12.330
Nene.

00:16:13.700 --> 00:16:14.570
Yes!

00:16:20.970 --> 00:16:22.930
Taiki!

00:16:24.230 --> 00:16:28.150
Taiki! You weren't lying when you 
said you wanted to save Nene!

00:16:29.730 --> 00:16:32.040
<i>Such a bright light...</i>

00:16:32.040 --> 00:16:35.410
<i>Could it be a power greater than X4's?</i>

00:16:41.390 --> 00:16:44.350
Sparrowmon! Your heart's 
reaching me loud and clear!

00:16:46.990 --> 00:16:49.230
Shoutmon X4!

00:16:49.230 --> 00:16:50.840
Okay!

00:16:51.090 --> 00:16:52.890
Sparrowmon!

00:16:52.890 --> 00:16:54.110
Right!

00:16:58.110 --> 00:17:00.160
DigiXros!

00:17:00.160 --> 00:17:01.770
DigiXros!

00:17:17.820 --> 00:17:20.350
Shoutmon X5!

00:17:28.530 --> 00:17:29.910
Shoutmon is flying!

00:17:30.700 --> 00:17:33.200
Impact Laser!

00:17:40.940 --> 00:17:42.690
Amazing...

00:17:42.690 --> 00:17:44.980
I feel power flowing 
through my whole body!

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:46.850
We can do it, X5!

00:17:46.850 --> 00:17:47.610
Yeah!

00:17:47.610 --> 00:17:48.150
Here it comes.

00:17:55.890 --> 00:17:58.060
That won't work.

00:17:59.820 --> 00:18:01.960
Now it's our turn!

00:18:02.540 --> 00:18:04.960
Meteor Impact!

00:18:12.400 --> 00:18:13.910
Go!

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:30.220
We did it!

00:18:30.970 --> 00:18:31.860
Look.

00:18:33.820 --> 00:18:36.180
The airborne shrine is collapsing.

00:18:37.160 --> 00:18:39.900
Now the Heaven Zone can go back to normal.

00:18:39.900 --> 00:18:40.880
Yeah.

00:18:43.890 --> 00:18:44.560
Huh?

00:18:44.560 --> 00:18:45.450
What's wrong?

00:18:45.870 --> 00:18:49.520
I can't get through to everyone 
who was at the airborne shrine.

00:18:49.520 --> 00:18:50.770
Taiki...

00:18:54.410 --> 00:18:59.440
Help!

00:19:01.910 --> 00:19:03.250
Found it!

00:19:11.350 --> 00:19:14.830
You defeated the evil ones and saved us.

00:19:14.830 --> 00:19:17.650
I entrust the Code Crown to you.

00:19:17.650 --> 00:19:18.720
Okay.

00:19:18.720 --> 00:19:21.590
However, let me give you a bit of advice.

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:26.170
The Digital World is now in chaos 
at the hands of the Bagra Empire.

00:19:26.170 --> 00:19:31.080
However, the Digimon of each 
Zone wish only for peace.

00:19:31.080 --> 00:19:34.810
Taiki, to accept each Zone's Code Crown

00:19:34.810 --> 00:19:37.420
means you must accept the 
feelings of its Digimon

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:41.060
and be truly prepared to 
bring peace to this world.

00:19:41.060 --> 00:19:42.860
It will be difficult.

00:19:45.590 --> 00:19:47.150
I'm counting on it.

00:19:49.460 --> 00:19:51.390
That's my Taiki!

00:19:51.390 --> 00:19:53.370
He's not giving it any thought again...

00:19:53.370 --> 00:19:55.610
Where's Nene, anyway?

00:19:57.260 --> 00:20:00.420
We found a piece of the Gehenna!

00:20:00.420 --> 00:20:01.200
Yes...

00:20:01.200 --> 00:20:02.510
Yay!

00:20:06.220 --> 00:20:08.590
Reload, DarkKnightmon.

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:13.490
Now your goal is fulfilled.

00:20:13.490 --> 00:20:15.420
Well done.

00:20:15.420 --> 00:20:19.350
This excellent dark power 
is mine, just as planned.

00:20:19.350 --> 00:20:20.830
And...

00:20:21.250 --> 00:20:24.700
Most importantly, Nene, you are safe.

00:20:25.640 --> 00:20:28.770
Don't worry me like that.

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:35.610
That aside, we must proceed 
to the next Zone immediately.

00:20:36.040 --> 00:20:37.700
Yes, you're right.

00:20:38.120 --> 00:20:41.260
Once there, we shall add 
that Zone's strongest

00:20:41.260 --> 00:20:43.490
Digimon to our ranks.

00:20:44.210 --> 00:20:46.400
I can't wait.

00:20:52.250 --> 00:20:54.620
<b>To Be Continued</b>

00:20:54.620 --> 00:20:58.140
<b>Digimon Data Collection</b>

00:20:55.340 --> 00:20:58.140
Digimon Data Collection!

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:02.070
<b>Listen to the Digimon's melody!</b>

00:20:58.140 --> 00:21:02.070
Listen to the melody of 
this Digimon I caught!

00:20:59.070 --> 00:21:00.070
<b>Melody starts in 3 seconds.</b>

00:21:00.070 --> 00:21:01.070
<b>Melody starts in 2 seconds.</b>

00:21:01.070 --> 00:21:02.070
<b>Melody starts in 1 second.</b>

00:21:03.910 --> 00:21:14.480
<b>[Type]</b>

00:21:06.840 --> 00:21:11.350
